./ I 00162300 $ 00162310 010                                                    
*  ESA/390 SUBSYSTEM IDENTIFICATION. SUBCHANNEL NUMBERS ARE    XA0002DK         
*  NOT DERIVABLE FROM DEVICE ADDRESSES -- THEY ARE ASSIGNED    XA0002DK         
*  IN CONFIGURATION ORDER -- SO CP LEARNS THE MAPPING WITH     XA0002DK         
*  STSCH AT INITIALISATION AND KEEPS IT HERE. HELD AS A        XA0002DK         
*  FULLWORD OF X'0001' || SUBCHANNEL SO THAT EVERY SSCH SITE   XA0002DK         
*  IS ONE INSTRUCTION, L R1,RDEVSSID, WITH NO SHIFTING OR      XA0002DK         
*  MASKING. THE SECOND FULLWORD KEEPS THE BLOCK A WHOLE        XA0002DK         
*  DOUBLEWORD LONGER, BECAUSE RDEVSIZE DIVIDES BY 8 AND        XA0002DK         
*  TRUNCATES.                                                  XA0002DK         
RDEVSSID DS    1F -           X'0001' || SUBCHANNEL NUMBER     XA0002DK         
         DS    1F -           RESERVED, KEEPS RDEVSIZE EXACT   XA0002DK         
